# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prepwright — what must never reach version control.
#
# Two categories, and the second is the one that bites:
#   1. Ordinary build and editor noise.
#   2. Study data. Every track holds a job description, a transcript of what the
#      candidate did not know, and a corpus researched for them. That is private
#      by default. It is ignored by directory, not by extension, so a new file
#      type inside a track is ignored the day it is invented.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- runtime study data: tracks, corpora, transcripts, state, backups -------
# The store normally lives in ~/.prepwright, outside this tree. PREPWRIGHT_HOME
# is a supported way to move it, and pointing it at a directory inside the repo
# is the obvious thing to do while debugging, so every name that store writes is
# ignored here as well.
/var/
/progress/
/tracks/
/corpus/
/archive/
/trash/
/quarantine/
/library.bak/
VERSION
library.db
library.db-*
library.lock
*.pwk
*.pwk.sha256
*.cards.jsonl
*.purge.json
*.part
*.state.json
state.json
high-water.json
corrupt-*.json
clobbered-*.json

# --- anything a job description or resume was dropped into ------------------
/inbox/
/imported/
*_JobDescription.md
*_FitReport.md

# --- local audit notes that quote what they flag ----------------------------
# An audit note has to reproduce the text it is asking you to change, so it is
# useful on disk and must never reach a commit.
/docs/RESIDUE-*.md

# --- secrets: nothing here should ever exist, so fail loudly if it does ------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keychain
credentials.json
auth.json
identities.txt
*.age

# --- python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
venv/
.venv/

# --- tooling scratch --------------------------------------------------------
# A browser-automation run drops page snapshots and console logs here, and a
# snapshot of the tutor page contains whatever was on it.
.playwright-cli/

# --- os / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
